          "messageID": "msg_ses_42_01",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "hi! quick question if you don't mind — i just ran `npm test` on my machine and everything is green, 48 passing. since the CI job is basically just running on my laptop through GitHub, i'm assuming if it's green here it'll be green there too, so i should be fine to open the PR now, right?"
