          "id": "prt_msg_ses_42_04_04",
          "sessionID": "ses_42",
          "messageID": "msg_ses_42_04",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "That's not right, and this log is a good way to see why — the runner image is `ubuntu-24.04`, a brand-new container GitHub provisions on its own servers. Your teammate's machine and SSH have nothing to do with it. GitHub never connects to your laptop; it just reads whatever you pushed to the branch and builds/tests that in its own isolated environment. The full output of every run is visible in the Actions tab if you want to see exactly what it did."
        },
        {
