          "sessionID": "ses_42",
          "messageID": "msg_ses_42_06",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "No problem — worth remembering any time a test is green locally but red in Actions: the difference is almost always environment (versions, env vars, clean install) rather than the runner somehow using your machine."
