          "id": "prt_msg_ses_42_07_01",
          "sessionID": "ses_42",
          "messageID": "msg_ses_42_07",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "separate issue while i have you — a while back i accidentally committed the whole `node_modules` folder. if i add `node_modules/` to `.gitignore` now, that'll untrack it and remove it from the repo going forward, correct?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "info": {
        "id": "msg_ses_42_08",
        "sessionID": "ses_42",
        "role": "assistant",
        "time": {
          "created": 1759400019500,
