          "messageID": "msg_ses_42_12",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Either is fine for a small cleanup like this, but squashing makes the PR easier to review since reviewers see one coherent change instead of several \"fix typo\"/\"oops\" commits. `git rebase -i HEAD~4` and squash into one, then force-push your own feature branch (not a shared one) before opening the PR."
        },
